# A Question of Taste's Etteh replies (accepted) against Everyone's Grudging's 109 (an Event), both accepted by GMs.
# Etteh has no script: Event ties cycle by the last event id, the first in container order (A Question of Taste
# first). Prog 0: 45 then 109. Prog 1: 47 (Progress) beats 109; finished (Prog 2), Prog 1 again (a GM): 47 again (the
# last id is 47, so a tie would now play 109). Prog 2: 49 then 109. Prog 4: 50 (Progress); A Question of Taste set
# available by a GM before the finish (the accepted section's Kazham 50 finish does not run: nothing), then accepted
# again at Prog 4: 50 again (the last id 50); finished: completed (3000 gil, fame +16, the mustZone). The completed
# replies (the mustZone cleared by two zone changes; rancorCurse 0, Prog 0, Option 0): 53 (Progress) beats 109, option
# 2: Option 1; Option 0 again (a GM): 53 again (the last id 53); 54 (Option 1) beats 109, option 2: nothing; 54 again
# (the last id 54), option 1: begun (Prog 1, still completed); Prog 3 (a GM): 57 beats 109; set available by a GM before
# the finish (nothing), completed again with Prog 3 (GMs): 57 again (the last id 57); finished: completed again.
lists Kazham/Etteh_Sulaej/onTrigger
char zone=Kazham pos=93.981,-14.5,-110.818 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 425
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste accepted
quest Outlands.EveryonesGrudging accepted
login
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Prog 0: 45 and 109 (Events) tie: 45
finish
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # the cycle: 109
finish
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 1               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Prog 1: 47 (Progress) beats 109
finish                                  # Prog 2
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 1               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # 47 again (the last id 47)
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Prog 2: 49 and 109 tie: the last id 47 is neither: 49
finish
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # the cycle: 109
finish
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 4               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Prog 4: 50 (Progress) beats 109
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste available   # a GM, 50 open
finish                                  # available: no Kazham 50 finish there: nothing
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste accepted    # a GM
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 4               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # 50 again (the last id 50)
finish                                  # completed: 3000 gil; fame +16; the mustZone
warp -64.619,-9.25,-8.853 WindurstWaters   # the mustZone cleared
warp 93.981,-14.5,-110.818 Kazham
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # completed, Prog 0, Option 0: 53 (Progress) beats 109
finish option=2                         # Option 1
charvar Quest[5][3]Option 0             # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # 53 again (the last id 53)
finish option=2                         # Option 1
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Option 1: 54 (Progress) beats 109
finish option=2                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # 54 again (the last id 54)
finish option=1                         # Prog 1; begun (still completed); Final Fantasy Part II
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 3               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # Prog 3: 57 (Progress) beats 109
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste available   # a GM, 57 open
finish                                  # available: no 57 finish there: nothing
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed   # a GM
charvar Quest[5][3]Prog 3               # a GM
trigger Etteh_Sulaej                    # 57 again (the last id 57)
finish                                  # completed again: 3000 gil; fame +16; the mustZone
